{"title":"The Saturday Autumn Colours Ashbridges Bay- Walk, Talk and Good Times! ","startsAt":"2026-10-17T15:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-17T18:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Hello everyone,\n\n\\*Please read carefully\\*\n\nLooking to enjoy the beautiful colours of autumn, have some great conversations and meet new people? Join us for a relaxed Saturday walk through Ashbridges Bay! We’ll take in the waterfront scenery, enjoy the fresh air and create plenty of opportunities to talk, laugh and make new friends along the way. Come by yourself or bring a friend—either way, you’ll receive a warm welcome!\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\n**Arrive between 2:30 pm and 3:00 pm**\n\n**Where to meet us:**\n\nMeetup us outside **Woodbine Station beside bike racks**\n**The Main Woodbine Station Entrance:** Located at the southeast corner of Woodbine Avenue and Strathmore Boulevard.\n\nWe will walk as a group from the station down to Ashbridges Bay\n\\*Most will stick around after for a bite to eat, ice cream and/or a beverage to sip on :)\n\nFurther details below:\n\nSincerely,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**The Saturday Autumn Colours Ashbridges Bay- Walk, Talk and Good Times!**\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n* A relaxed walk along the Ashbridges Bay waterfront\n* Ice breaker games to get to know one another\n* Plenty of opportunities to mix, mingle and meet new people\n* A comfortable pace that allows everyone to walk and talk\n* Beautiful views of the lake, beach, parkland and surrounding area\n* A positive atmosphere for both newcomers and returning members\n\nPlease wear comfortable walking shoes and bring water, sunscreen or anything else you may need for the weather. The purpose of this event is simple: get outside, enjoy the day and make a few new connections!\n\\* Many of us will hit a local pub/restaurant after the walk for dinner and beverages- plan to join us for that if you can\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:Steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nParking near Woodbine Station:\n(Although I encourage you to take subway if you can)","venue":{"name":"Woodbine Subway Station","address":"991 Woodbine Avenue, Toronto","lat":43.68641,"lng":-79.31273,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Soul City Social Club (Toronto, Canada)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/c/c/7/highres_536196039.jpeg"}